                        "entry_id": "f760f836-8991-35a2-927e-9d3923dce434",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Relatif à cette mode et à ceux qui s'y adonnent."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f78b6b0e-d476-4f66-9176-4df56dafa914",
                                "sense_id": "c2f935a5-7af2-3e03-9726-6d736461866e",
                                "text": "Pour ceux qui préfèrent une tenue plus en phase avec la nature et donc de style plus lumbersexuel, voici d'autres indispensables : […]."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "62daa645-ccf4-4c6a-a91f-4fe981b783ca",
                        "source_entry_id": "f760f836-8991-35a2-927e-9d3923dce434",
                        "source_sense_id": "c2f935a5-7af2-3e03-9726-6d736461866e",
                        "target_lang_word": "lumbersexual",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "lumbersexual",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "304d420e-aebc-39f2-981c-f922821b3ae8",
                                        "entry_id": "d5be51ce-f964-3f35-9723-38aa311dceed",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An urban man who affects a rugged, outdoorsy look, typified by plaid shirts and a full beard."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "attributive",
                                            "slang",
                                            "sometimes"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c7f8e784-181c-418a-b898-f5307094d9ae",
                                                "sense_id": "304d420e-aebc-39f2-981c-f922821b3ae8",
                                                "text": "From the rise of the lumbersexual, outdoorsmen's answer to the metrosexual, to the use of beards to sell anything from clothing to beer, beards are cool once again."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9adb3d9d-ac8d-4b67-b24f-f22a194d9dfa",
                                                "sense_id": "304d420e-aebc-39f2-981c-f922821b3ae8",
                                                "text": "Trend-hunters announced last year that we had reached “peak beard”, saturation point with the sort of facial hair that has become the calling card of the urban hipster or “lumbersexual”."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "485332c8-93a8-4769-a2c5-6f55c5746c54",
                                                "sense_id": "304d420e-aebc-39f2-981c-f922821b3ae8",
                                                "text": "My beef isn’t with glamping, despite its issues (unfortunate portmanteau, the image of lumbersexuals playing Ralph Lauren at summer camp). But keep it out of our parks."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "40d6ba91-55f9-36ee-90a8-f08d7d28f7aa",
